-- Project ACX (2026-11-18): 104 retail portal drop points carry the wrong dungeon cell. The spot (x, y, z) is right, but
-- its floor is in another cell of the same landblock; the retail client finds the right cell from the position, AC:Unreal
-- trusts the cell, finds no floor and strands the player in portal space ("world entry failed"; Dungeon Maggreth on
-- 2026-11-17, 17 of 459 contract entrances on the Entrance Tester run). Each update keeps the exact spot and sets the cell
-- whose floor is under it, found from the DATs (~/Work/ac/tools/havencells findcell). markers.json has the same cells.
-- Re-runnable: rows already fixed no longer match.
